{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Go forth.</b> He speaks to the people of the exile." "<b>Bring her out.</b> As in public. And it is not enough that He redeems His people, until He works a new wonder for them when they return to Zion, that they do not thirst in the ruins where HaShem led them."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:37.309861104Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}